<section class="ph-page-hero">   <div class="ph-wrap">     <p class="ph-kicker">The Nursery</p>     <h1 class="ph-h2">The Operational Heart of Pheladelfia</h1>     <p class="ph-lead">More than 1.5 million square feet in Al Ajban, Abu Dhabi.</p>   </div> </section> <section class="ph-services">   <div class="ph-wrap">     <div class="ph-service-block ph-split">       <div>         <h2 class="ph-h3">Curation. Cultivation. Delivery.</h2>         <p class="ph-copy">Located in Al Ajban, Abu Dhabi, Pheladelfia's specialist nursery is where plants are propagated, grown, received, inspected, organised and prepared for project requirements.</p>         <p class="ph-copy">It also provides the controlled space necessary for imported material to adapt to local environmental conditions before final selection and delivery.</p>         <p class="ph-copy">Farm No. 563 &amp; 564, Al Ajban, Muwailih, Abu Dhabi</p>       </div>       <div class="ph-photo" data-ph-page-photo role="img" aria-label="The nursery"></div>     </div>          <div class="ph-steps">       <div>         <div class="ph-step-num">01</div>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Botanical Curation</h3>         <p>Selected for species, height, trunk character, canopy balance, climatic suitability and long-term landscape performance.</p>       </div>       <div>         <div class="ph-step-num">02</div>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Nursery Cultivation</h3>         <p>Propagated, grown, received, inspected and acclimatised across more than 1.5 million square feet.</p>       </div>       <div>         <div class="ph-step-num">03</div>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Project Logistics</h3>         <p>Quality control, technical coordination, import and export, and establishment guidance.</p>       </div>     </div>     <a class="ph-btn" href="/contact">Arrange a nursery visit</a>   </div> </section> 